  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PADEO &#x2013; Combi-track study visit to the Netherlands (CSS23NG01A)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">From 28-21 September 2023, the Netherlands Ministry of Foreign Affairs (DDE) and the Netherlands Enterprise Agency (RVO) organised a PADEO Conference for all PADEO teams of the 11 PADEO countries. This conference offered a comprehensive, enriching experience with various activities, including keynotes, panel discussions, workshops, games, team sessions, and a marketplace for external partners. This format fosters learning, collaboration, and inspiration, allowing attendees to exchange knowledge and explore practical applications in PMEL, which is very relevant for the Horticulture combi-track of Nigeria.Participating in the PADEO conference contributes to understanding of systems thinking approach relevant for further designing of the Nigeria Horticulture combi-track.The goal of this combi-track is to create a thriving, nutritious, and sustainable industry, that is able to meet the rising demand for food and generates employment and investment opportunities throughout the densely populated Southwest of Nigeria.</narrative>
  </description>
